# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# The site is organised into the /moves/ and /combos/ directories plus the flat
# /training demo page. Pages' built-in "pretty URLs" would send /jab.html -> /jab,
# which no longer exists, so every old flat URL gets an explicit 301 to its new
# home.
# Explicit rules win over the built-in redirect (redirects run before headers),
# so the nested .html addresses also get a permanent 301 instead of a 307.
/index.html    /    301
/fight.html    /training    301
/fight    /training    301
/media/glb/combo_jab_cross_leadhook_cross_dup.glb    /media/glb/combo_jab_cross_leadhook_cross_alt.glb    301
/moves    /moves/    301
/combos    /combos/    301
/moves/index.html    /moves/    301
/combos/index.html    /combos/    301
